"WP1014802","helmet":"WP1012202"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1048","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[22,33,71,70,82,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014802","helmet":"WP1012202"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1048","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[22,33,71,70,82,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014802","helmet":"WP1012202"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[22,33,71,70,82,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014802","helmet":"WP1012202"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[22,33,71,70,82,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014802","helmet":"WP1012202"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1002","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[22,33,71,70,82,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014802","helmet":"WP1012202"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"吴臣陆绩之女。因生于郁林而得名，陆郁生聪慧好学，受父亲陆绩精心教育，诗文俊秀大气。十三岁时嫁给同郡的张白，但不久张白便因其兄张温因滥用职权被惩罚而受牵连，导致陆郁生年轻守寡，并向外公开永不改嫁，并张白家中继续照顾姐姐。后来此事传到宫中，孙权称赞其为“义姑”。","tc":"吳臣陸績之女。因生于郁林而得名，陸郁生聰慧好學，受父親陸績精心教育，詩文俊秀大氣。十三歲時嫁給同郡的張白，但不久張白便因其兄張溫因濫用職權被懲罰而受牽連，導致陸郁生年輕守寡，并向外公開永不改嫁，并張白家中繼續照顧姐姐。后來此事傳到宮中，孫權稱贊其為“義姑”。","en":"The daughter of the Wu official Lu Ji. Named after Yulin, the place of her birth, Lu Yusheng was intelligent and studious. Under the careful tutelage of her father Lu Ji, she became accomplished in poetry and prose. At thirteen, she married Zhang Bai of the same commandery, but Zhang Bai was soon implicated when his brother Zhang Wen was punished for abuse of authority, leaving Lu Yusheng widowed at a young age. She publicly declared she would never remarry, and continued to care for her sister-in-law in the Zhang household. When word of this reached the palace, Sun Quan praised her as the ‘Righteous Lady.’","jp":"呉の臣・陸績の娘。郁林で生まれたことからその名が付けられた。陸郁生は聡明で学問を好み、父・陸績の手厚い教育を受け、その詩文は端麗で気品に満ちていた。十三歳の時に同郡の張白に嫁いだが、まもなく張白が兄の張温の職権乱用による処罰に連座したため、若くして未亡人となった。彼女は生涯再婚しないことを公言し、張白の家にとどまって義姉の世話を続けた。後にこのことが宮中に伝わると、孫権は彼女を「義姑」と称賛した。","kr":"오나라 신하 육적의 딸. 욱림에서 태어나 울생(郁生)이라는 이름을 얻었다. 총명하고 배움을 좋아하여 부친 육적의 세심한 가르침을 받았으며, 시문이 빼어나고 기품이 넘쳤다. 13세에 같은 군 출신인 장백에게 출가했으나, 얼마 지나지 않아 장백이 형 장온의 직권남용 사건에 연좌되어 처벌을 받았다. 이로 인해 육욱생은 젊은 나이에 홀로 남겨졌음에도 평생 개가하지 않겠다고 선언하고 장씨 가문에 남아 시누이를 극진히 돌보았다. 훗날 이 사실이 궁중에 알려지자 손권이 그 절개를 높이 사 '의고(義姑)'라 칭송했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10514","remark":"","surname":"陆","surnameTc":"陸","surnameEn":"Lu","surnameJp":"陸","surnameKr":"육","surnameOther":"","name":"郁生","nameTc":"郁生","nameEn":"Yusheng","nameJp":"郁生","nameKr":"울생","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"陆郁生","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"224","city":"CS1053","gender":"1","rule":"22","force":"33","wise":"71","politics":"70","charm":"82","will":"75","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"2","wiseTalent":"8","politic